 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "The Secret to a Happy Marriage Is Drinking Together at Night"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja-ro": "Fuufu no Hiketsu wa Banshaku Desu"
   },
   {
    "ja": "夫婦のヒケツは晩酌です"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "After six years of marriage, this hardworking couple barely sees each other due to mismatched work schedules. Despite their busy lives, they’ve found the ultimate secret to keeping their love alive—late-night drinks together! From sharing a quiet toast to getting a little too tipsy, their drunken heart-to-hearts keep their bond strong and their passion burning. Can a little alcohol be the cure for a fading spark? A heartwarming and hilarious tipsy romance about love, laughter, and liquor!"
  },
